bundle,resources.assets:3300:tips,attribution_and_creator_handle,"<size=18><color=#FFAF60>All Roads Lead to Roof 5-3<size=12>
<alpha=#60>(Level made with help from 小董玩得好, edited by MirteorShower)</color>
<alpha=#04>Best Solution: 650 Sun left
<alpha=#FF><size=320>
<size=18><color=#990000>Lifelink Ladder Zombie</color> has a ladder that cannot be attracted by Magnet-shroom plants and continuously adds <color=#b30000>curse stacks</color> onto the plant it is placed on. If a plant has more <color=#b30000>curse stacks</color> than its current HP, it will instantly die.
Note that if you kill the Lifelink Ladder Zombie itself, the ladder also disappears, so make sure to keep the zombie alive for as long as possible.<alpha=#FF>Tip: Do not hesitate to use your <color=#FFFF00>Coffe Beans</color>! You practically have unlimited money in this level.<alpha=#FF>
<size=360>
