bundle,resources.assets:3489:zombies.38.introduce,requires_pc_translation_or_terminology_review,"<color=#3D1400>机械巨人僵尸，埃德加博士的最新发明，继飞艇之后又一大战争武器。“老实说，它们并没有思想。”埃德加博士如是说道，“因此，它们也更和平，不会给植物留下心灵创伤，反映了我族一贯爱好和平的立场。”不过，被压扁的坚果可就没那么好说话了。
</color>"
bundle,resources.assets:3489:zombies.39.introduce,requires_pc_translation_or_terminology_review,"<color=#3D1400>历时数月，僵王博士的最新作品-第二代机械巨人闪亮登场。和前作相比，新型号的机械巨兽换装了更坚固的合金装甲，更稳定的钢制架构，以及便于区分型号而在眼睛里安装的红色LED灯泡。
</color>"
bundle,resources.assets:3497:tips,attribution_and_creator_handle,"<size=18>Making Waves 3-8<size=12>
<alpha=#60>(Level made by 树桩上的火炎, edited by MirteorShower)
<alpha=#04>Best Solution: 625 Sun left
<alpha=#00>.<alpha=#FF><size=18>

















Spicy Squash Zombie can instantly wipe an entire lane, as long as it isn't chilled. (See the Almanac for details)
<alpha=#FF>Keep it warm. Use fertilizer and ice-fire conflict to prevent it from getting chilled.
Tip: Bugs may occur when using the Spicy Squash Zombie along with a higher game speed. If you are using the Spicy Squash Zombie, please do not try to enable higher game speeds...




















"
bundle,resources.assets:3524:tips,attribution_and_creator_handle,"<size=18>Polarity Shift  4-3<size=12>
<alpha=#60>(Level made by help from 小董玩的好, edited by MirteorShower)
<alpha=#04>Best Solution: 725 Sun left
<alpha=#FF><size=322>
<size=18>Zomppelins are powerful flying units with high HP that can bomb an entire lane.
Their downside is their high cost and inability to eat brains, so they're best used only when truly needed.<alpha=#FF>
<size=16>Tip: When using Lumos Angler's lane-switching, make sure its lane is empty (if zombies are already present, switching won't trigger).
<size=362>
"
bundle,resources.assets:3528:tips,attribution_and_creator_handle,"<size=18><color=#FFAF60>All Roads Lead to Roof 5-2<size=12>
<alpha=#60>(Level made by help from 树桩上的火炎, edited by MirteorShower)</color>
<alpha=#04>Best Solution: 650 Sun left
<alpha=#FF><size=320>
<size=18>	<color=#00BD00>Melon Pogo Zombie</color> will charge for a while after being placed, then leap forward about 4 tiles (ignoring most plants along the way).
	Like Pogo Zombies, they won't eat brains while on their Pogos: you'll need to knock them down with Umbrella Leaves or Tall-nuts.
<alpha=#FF>Tip: Try using the fusion techniques you learned from Chapter 3 on plants placed on <color=#00E3E3>Ice Pots</color>.<alpha=#FF>
<size=360>
"
bundle,resources.assets:3565:talentDatas.12.name,hidden_placeholder,<size=0><size=0><size=0><size=0><size=0><size=0><size=0><size=0><size=0><size=0>至极手速
bundle,resources.assets:3567:tips,attribution_and_creator_handle,"<size=18>Polarity Shift  4-7<size=12>
<alpha=#60>(Level made with help from 小董玩得好, edited by MirteorShower)
<alpha=#04>Best Solution: 650 Sun left
<alpha=#FF><size=320>
<size=18>Buck-shooter zombies won't get insta-killed by Magnet-shrooms but they still take damage from Pumpkin Morphs.
Also, Buckshoot-copter zombies can be deployed over water. Sure, they'll disappear eventually,
but not before doing some serious damage to the frontline.
Tip: Zombies killed by Doomplate-shroom drop more Iron Buckets.<alpha=#FF>
<size=360>
"
